{"sourceUrl":"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/info/1024/6632.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:06.248723+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/info/1024/6632.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>人工智能</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>院接收</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）网上预报名系统已开通，现将相关安排通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民</span></span><span><span>，热爱祖国</span></span><span><span>，遵纪守法，品德良好</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>身心健康</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.本科学习成绩优秀，在目前就读学校能取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格并有意到我院深造的国内高校202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.英语成绩须符合以下任一项：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>(1)通过全国大学英语六级考试，成绩425分及以上，或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（550分及以上）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>(2)TOEFL成绩90分（120分制）及以上或4.5分（6分制）及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>(3)IELTS(A类/学术类)成绩6分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>(4)GRE成绩在310分及以上，GMAT成绩在640分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>(5)英语专业四级(及以上)考试合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招生类型及专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.直博：智能科学与技术、</span></span><span><span>低空技术与工程</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>控制科学与工程、人工智能、运筹学与控制论</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.学硕：智能科学与技术</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含低空技术与工程</span></span><span><span>）、</span></span><span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含</span></span><span><span>人工智能</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>、运筹学与控制论</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>专硕：</span></span><span><span>电子信息（</span></span><span><span>控制工程、人工智能</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、报名方式及流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.报名</span></span><span><span>时间及网址</span></span></p>\n<p><span>即日起至</span><span><span>2</span>02<span>6年</span>8月<span>24日12：00</span></span><span>，登录“南开大学研究生招生网”报名，网址</span><a href=\"http://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/</span></a><span>。学院将在报名结束后，对所有报名考生进行集中审核。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.材料准备</span></p>\n<p><span>在系统报名的同时，请将以下材料按顺序扫描合并到一个PDF文件，PDF文件请上传至https://f.wps.cn/g/qlal0cQC/。上传材料截止时间为</span><span>8月25日12：00</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>系统已报名但未按要求提交材料</span><span>视为自动放弃申请，不再另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>【</span><span>重要提醒</span><span>】</span><span>【</span><span>意向导师</span><span>】</span><span><span><span>处建议提前跟意向导师沟通</span></span>（限报一个，直博导师须具备博导资格）。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>实验室信息：</span></span><a href=\"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/info/1024/6620.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/info/1024/6620.htm</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>导师信息：</span></span><a href=\"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/szdw/js_yjy_.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/szdw/js_yjy_.htm</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span>申请材料包括：</span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>)《南开大学202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生报名信息表》（在报名网站系统中打印，需本人签字，报名号为</span><span>00000000不影响提交）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>2</span><span>)</span><span>《</span><span>南开大学人工智能学院</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span><span>预推免报名表》（附件</span><span>1）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>3</span><span>)本科学习成绩单和获得推免资格的证明（如无推免资格证明可用专业成绩排名代替，均需加盖本科院校教务部门的公章）；</span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>4</span><span>)国家英语六级考试成绩单或报名条件所列其他英语成绩证明；</span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>5</span><span>)身份证（正反面扫描，合并在同一页A4纸上）；</span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>6</span><span>)体现自身学术水平的获奖证书、代表性学术论文</span><span>（</span><span>提供首页即可</span><span>）</span><span>等复印件</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>(</span><span>7</span><span>)</span><span><span>专家推荐函（仅直博</span> <span>附件</span><span>2）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>报名直接攻博的同学，联系好报名导师后，将两封专家推荐函签字扫描版与其他申请材料一并提交。专家推荐函须分别由两位所报名专业领域内的教授或相当专业技术职称以上的专家推荐签字。推荐函纸质版请保存好，新生入学后需装入个人档案。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>窗体顶端</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>面试选拔</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将</span></span><span><span>在系统报名结束后</span></span><span><span>组织专家审核组</span></span><span><span>统一</span></span><span><span>对报名材料进行审核和筛选，</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>发布入围面试名单</span></span><span><span>及面试时间</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>请申报同学关注学院网站通知并保持邮件电话等联系方式畅通，提前预留时间，做好相关准备。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>四、</span><strong><span><span>其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.获得推免资格的本科生，可选择报名我院三年制硕士研究生或五年制博士研究生（直接攻博）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.请关注南开大学研究生招生网站通知（http://yzb.nankai.edu.cn/），以上内容如有变化，以最新通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.所有硕士推荐免试生及直博生必须通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址:</span></span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></a><span><span>进行报名，并在该系统中完成全部流程，否则推荐免试无效。目前该系统尚未开通，请以教育部公布时间为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人资格。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span><span>aijxb@nankai.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>南开大学人工智能学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>                                                          202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"39cae0f704625a25bf75a1f0d5737a1bf544732be2e7c15b2fc91f61ce4e8bf2","textLength":1681,"sourceSha256":"800df542c31a23557413248d3e8929617b4b08116c7d88dfdf403b524483c617","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-南开大学人工智能学院2027年预推免报名表.doc","url":"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550738966&wbfileid=15092694"},{"name":"附件2-申请攻读南开大学博士学位研究生专家推荐函.docx","url":"https://ai.nankai.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550738966&wbfileid=15092693"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8987fb73783102c053e8","title":"2026年南开大学人工智能学院接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:06.248723+00:00"}
